{"id":"f7706a8186f343cf","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Cofinal Subproduct","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct — ZFC Pcf4 Cofinal Subproduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct — ZFC Pcf4 Cofinal Subproduct","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-proper-ideal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-cofinal-subproduct — ZFC Pcf4 Cofinal Subproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e409b262805c593e\" href=\"?note=e409b262805c593e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-proper-ideal\">58-df-zfc-proper-ideal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span> (index set, proper ideal, and cofinal family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S\\)</span> (proper-ideal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4CofinalSubproduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4CofinalSubproduct}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subproduct} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4CofinalSubproduct}_S(A,J,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S(J,A)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in A\\mid g(a)&gt;f(a)\\}\\in J\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subproduct} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4CofinalSubproduct}_S(A,J,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S(J,A)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in A\\mid g(a)&gt;f(a)\\}\\in J\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is cofinality of the product under eventual domination modulo the proper ideal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-proper-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"e409b262805c593e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-proper-ideal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,J,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4CofinalSubproduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}subproduct} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4CofinalSubproduct}_S(A,J,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ProperIdeal}_S(J,A)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\forall g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\{a\\in A\\mid g(a)>f(a)\\}\\in J\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":973,"backlinks":[{"id":"86b32ee240a3c099","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3083","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/5